      "rationale": "The REMAP study inserted the RIEDL peptide at multiple positions within EGFR domain III (dN313 construct, residues 313-482) and expressed constructs on the cell surface for antibody-binding assays. The EMab-51 epitope was localized to residues 375-380; insertions outside this epitope were tolerated for surface expression. Position 420 is inferred to lie in a tolerated loop region away from the epitope and EGF-binding surface. EGF signaling function was NOT MEASURED. [validation: detected_only; position: inferred; source: paper; entailment_verified: True]",
